      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Due to the exceptionally high level of interest in this property, we kindly ask that there are no telephone enquiries.\r\n\r\nHenry Wiltshire Estate Agents are delighted to bring to the rental market this luxurious, top-of-the-range 4-bedroom semi-detached home in Naas.\r\n\r\nWelcome to this exceptional residence, where designer interiors, elegant finishes and thoughtful functionality combine to create a truly impressive home.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented property seamlessly blends luxury, privacy and modern living, with a sophisticated interior designed for both comfortable family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you enter, the quality and attention to detail are immediately apparent. The property features a stunning open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, bespoke built-in shelving, warm timber finishes and carefully selected contemporary furnishings.\r\n\r\nThe impressive accommodation includes four spacious bedrooms, with the principal bedroom offering a striking feature wall, upholstered headboard and a beautifully calm, neutral colour palette. The remaining bedrooms are equally well presented, while the contemporary bathrooms complement the overall high-end finish.\r\n\r\nA Truly Exceptional Garden\r\nTo the rear, the property boasts a spectacular private landscaped garden, providing a peaceful outdoor oasis and an extension of the home's living space.\r\n\r\nThe garden features extensive decking, mature planting, a beautiful ornamental pond, outdoor dining area and a covered pergola, creating an exceptional setting for relaxing and entertaining.\r\n\r\nA charming glasshouse and mature greenery further enhance this unique outdoor space, while the established planting provides an excellent level of privacy.\r\n\r\nProperty Features\r\n• Luxurious 4-bedroom semi-detached home\r\n• Top-of-the-range designer interiors\r\n• Beautifully presented throughout\r\n• Contemporary open-plan kitchen/dining/living space\r\n• Large kitchen island\r\n• Bespoke built-in shelving and storage\r\n• Four well-proportioned bedrooms\r\n• High-quality contemporary bathrooms\r\n• Stunning landscaped private garden\r\n• Extensive decking\r\n•  Outdoor entertaining area\r\n• Ornamental pond\r\n• Glasshouse\r\n• Mature planting and excellent privacy\r\n• Stylish contemporary lighting and finishes\r\n• Excellent location in Naas\r\n\r\n Elsmore is a truly exceptional rental property, offering sophisticated interiors, generous living accommodation and an outstanding private garden.\r\n\r\n\r\nVIEWING & ENQUIRIES\r\nDue to the exceptionally high level of interest in this property, we kindly ask that there are no telephone enquiries.\r\n\r\nAll enquiries and viewing requests are to be made by email only."
      },
